            "expanded_url": "https://x.com/countykerry/status/1980276620351963334/photo/1",
            "ext_alt_text": "This is a public notice poster from Kerry County Council.\n\nIt has a red header labeled “NOTICE:” and announces the Construction of Killarney Park Road Active Travel Scheme.\nThe works are on Park Road, Killarney, taking place on Tuesday 21st and Wednesday 22nd October 2025 from 7:00 am onward. A Stop and Go system will operate, and drivers are advised to use Countess Road as an alternative route due to possible delays.\n\nAt the bottom are Kerry County Council logos, the website www.kerrycoco.ie\n, and social media icons.\nThe background shows a main road in Killarney lined with houses and trees, with mountains in the distance.",
